3020 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Thesis\n\nWhat\047s your core belief about how a great customer service agent should work\054 and how does your implementation reflect that\077\050\050I believe a great customer service agent should\072\n\nHave authentication \024\240know who it\047s talking to before the conversation starts\056\nBe embedded in the customer experience\050\050e\056g\056\054 the website\051\054 not bolted on\056\nHave context \050e\056g\056\054 the Order \174 Concierge page\051\056\nRelay only what a source says \050e\056g\056\054 an FAQ\054\050a live order lookup\051 \024\240never make anything up\056\nAct on its own when it\047s routine \024 and let code\054 not judgment\054 make sure the moments that matter reach a person\056\nKnow when to escalate and where \024 every question has an owner \050e\056g\056\054 a recommendation \222 the booksellers\051 \024\240and a conversation with your customer is valuable\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 3021 0 R
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

